  "highlights": [
    "402 issues tracked for pCloud 15.0, 79% done (316), 8% in progress (34), 13% still to do (52).",
    "FIPS 140-3 compliance is essentially wrapped across Vault, PVWA and CPM; only the forward-looking FedRAMP Q2'26 and Q1'27 PVWA requirements remain in flight.",
    "AWS PrivateLink support shipped end-to-end for PVWA, closing out the Private Networking theme.",
    "Centralization into the unified Admin Portal and PVWA/PSM dark-mode rollout are the biggest active workstreams (5 of 11 items still in progress).",
    "CPM-to-SRS migration continues: CPM install is now blocked on SRS tenants, while Lloyds' 350K-account and account-group commitments remain in progress.",
    "PSM modernization is mostly done (WinSCP 6.5, .NET Core v10, Command Center, registration overhaul); only the SM page-movement testing epic is still active.",
    "22 bugs tracked, 20 done, concentrated in PVWA's Discovered Accounts/Incoming Requests flows and PSM session recording/monitoring, plus a PVWA REST API memory-leak fix."
